-container-core-group-is-layout-831b2db5 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<p class=\"lab-experiment-caption has-medium-font-size wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>\u65e0 RIS \u65f6 WSKR \u4e25\u91cd\u53d7\u9650\uff0cRIS \u90e8\u7f72\u4e0d\u53ef\u6216\u7f3a<\/strong>\uff1a\u5728\u4e03\u5c0f\u533a\u4eff\u771f\u573a\u666f\u4e2d\uff0c\u65e0 RIS \u65b9\u6848\u7684 WSKR \u5728\u9ad8\u53d1\u5c04\u529f\u7387\u533a\u95f4\u9971\u548c\u4e8e\u4ec5 <strong>2.5 bits\/channel use<\/strong>\uff0c\u6839\u672c\u539f\u56e0\u5728\u4e8e\u975e\u4e92\u6613\u7684\u5c0f\u533a\u95f4\u5e72\u6270\u4e3b\u5bfc\u4e86\u4e0a\u4e0b\u884c\u4fe1\u9053\u4f30\u8ba1\uff0c\u4f7f\u5f97\u5bc6\u94a5\u4e00\u81f4\u6027\u4e25\u91cd\u6076\u5316\uff08BDR \u9971\u548c\u4e8e\u7ea6 0.34\uff09\u3002\u6240\u63d0\u8054\u5408\u4f18\u5316\u7b97\u6cd5\u80fd\u591f\u6301\u7eed\u63d0\u5347 WSKR\uff0c\u663e\u8457\u8d85\u8d8a\u6240\u6709\u57fa\u7ebf\u65b9\u6848\u3002<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group lab-paper-results is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-3a88641f wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-uagb-image uagb-block-01e98235 wp-block-uagb-image--layout-default wp-block-uagb-image--effect-static wp-block-uagb-image--align-none wp-container-content-9cfa9a5a\"><figure class=\"wp-block-uagb-image__figure\"><img decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"https:\/\/jiushihema.github.io\/pls_lab\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/PixPin_2026-03-08_15-20-10.png ,https:\/\/jiushihema.github.io\/pls_lab\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/PixPin_2026-03-08_15-20-10.png 780w, https:\/\/jiushihema.github.io\/pls_lab\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/PixPin_2026-03-08_15-20-10.png 360w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 480px) 150px\" src=\"https:\/\/jiushihema.github.io\/pls_lab\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/PixPin_2026-03-08_15-20-10.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"uag-image-987\" width=\"802\" height=\"656\" title=\"PixPin_2026-03-08_15-20-10\" loading=\"lazy\" role=\"img\"\/><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div cla